message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below, and cite the datasets it uses (see DATA.md)."
title: "Wearable SSVEP decoding for new users: calibration cost, dry electrodes, honest evaluation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Almuhammad Alali"
    given-names: "Salman"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SAamal1076/BCI"
license: "PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-11-14
abstract: >-
  A pre-specified analysis of SSVEP decoding from an 8-channel wearable EEG headband for a new user, on the
  open dataset of Zhu et al. (2021): dry against wet electrodes, calibration time, adaptation without labels.
  Every choice was made on 68 people; 15 tests were run once on the other 34.
